#
# docker build context 可能包含大量圖片上傳檔，會讓建置極慢
# 這份 .dockerignore 會排除這些檔案，讓 api 映像 rebuild 更快
#

api/public/uploads
api/public/uploads/**

# composer 可能產生/下載的快取目錄（可選，避免誤帶入）
api/vendor
api/vendor/**

# Windows 系統檔
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

node_modules
.nuxt
dist
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
vendor
writable/cache/*
writable/logs/*
writable/session/*
writable/debugbar/*
docker/
!docker/php/php.ini
!docker/php/entrypoint.sh
docker-compose*.yml
compose.yaml
.dockerignore
README*.md
docs/
